      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Telegram VA - Event Reminders (Phase 3)\n\n**Purpose:** Checks every 30 minutes for events starting in ~30 minutes and sends a Telegram reminder.\n\n**Setup Required:**\n1. Update Google Calendar OAuth2 credential\n2. Update Telegram Bot credential and PLACEHOLDER_CHAT_ID\n\n⏰ Runs every 30 minutes, filters events starting in 25-35 min window"
